* MFS FORMAT DEFINITION (DIF/DOF)
FMTSTU1  FMT
         DEV TYPE=3270
         DIV TYPE=INOUT
* Input Definition
FMTSTU1I MSG  TYPE=INPUT,SOR=(DIFSTU1,1)
         SEG
         MFSFIELD ID=SCREEN-ID,LEN=5,POS=(1,10)
* Output Definition
FMTSTU1O MSG  TYPE=OUTPUT,SOR=(DOFSTU1,1)
         SEG
         MFSFIELD ID=SCREEN-NAME,LEN
